{"id":"huntik:page:4242","page_id":4242,"title":"Darksleep","kind":"spell","namespace":0,"summary":"Darksleep is a spell that cause the target to fall asleep or to lose consciousness. During casting, caster's eyes glow violet while the hand is engulfed by a violet mist, which then surrounds the victim.","profile":{"image":{"text":"File:S1E25_Zhalia_darksleep.jpg","wikitext":"File:S1E25_Zhalia_darksleep.jpg","links":[]},"aura":{"text":"Violet","wikitext":"Violet","links":[]},"class":{"text":"Mental","wikitext":"Mental","links":[]},"users":{"text":"Silent Soldiers \n Zhalia Moon","wikitext":"[[Silent Soldiers]] <br/> [[Zhalia Moon]]","links":[{"target_title":"Silent Soldiers","label":"Silent Soldiers","target_id":"huntik:page:4383","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Silent_Soldiers","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4383"},{"target_title":"Zhalia Moon","label":"Zhalia Moon","target_id":"huntik:page:2000","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Zhalia_Moon","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2000"}]},"first":{"text":"\"Divide and Conquer\"","wikitext":"\"[[Divide and Conquer]]\"","links":[{"target_title":"Divide and Conquer","label":"Divide and Conquer","target_id":"huntik:page:2722","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Divide_and_Conquer","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2722"}]}},"infoboxes":[{"name":"Infobox spell","parameters":[{"name":"image","value_wikitext":"File:S1E25_Zhalia_darksleep.jpg","value_text":"File:S1E25_Zhalia_darksleep.jpg","links":[]},{"name":"aura","value_wikitext":"Violet","value_text":"Violet","links":[]},{"name":"class","value_wikitext":"Mental","value_text":"Mental","links":[]},{"name":"users","value_wikitext":"[[Silent Soldiers]] <br/> [[Zhalia Moon]]","value_text":"Silent Soldiers \n Zhalia Moon","links":[{"target_title":"Silent Soldiers","label":"Silent Soldiers","target_id":"huntik:page:4383","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Silent_Soldiers","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4383"},{"target_title":"Zhalia Moon","label":"Zhalia Moon","target_id":"huntik:page:2000","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Zhalia_Moon","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2000"}]},{"name":"first","value_wikitext":"\"[[Divide and Conquer]]\"","value_text":"\"Divide and Conquer\"","links":[{"target_title":"Divide and Conquer","label":"Divide and Conquer","target_id":"huntik:page:2722","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Divide_and_Conquer","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2722"}]}],"start":0,"end":176}],"sections":[{"heading":"History","level":2,"wikitext":"This spell was used by [[Zhalia Moon]] at [[Paris Catacombs]] on [[Unnamed Suit 001]].{{Source|Divide and Conquer}}\n\nThis spell was used again by [[Zhalia Moon]] at [[The Professor's castle]] on one of [[the Professor]]'s Elite [[Suits]]. {{source|The Divine Comedy}} \n\nThe spell was used by Zhalia to knock out one of [[Wilder]]'s [[Suits]] in [[Klaus' bookshop]]. Later, a [[Silent Soldier]] used it against another [[Suit]] who was guarding the entrance{{Source|The Blood Spiral}}\n\nZhalia later used Darksleep in [[Venice, Italy]] to render [[Den Fears]] unconscious and rescue [[Harrison Fears]]. {{source|Boys Will Be Seekers}}\n\n{{Clear}}","text":"This spell was used by Zhalia Moon at Paris Catacombs on Unnamed Suit 001.[Divide and Conquer]\n\nThis spell was used again by Zhalia Moon at The Professor's castle on one of the Professor's Elite Suits. [The Divine Comedy] \n\nThe spell was used by Zhalia to knock out one of Wilder's Suits in Klaus' bookshop. Later, a Silent Soldier used it against another Suit who was guarding the entrance[The Blood Spiral]\n\nZhalia later used Darksleep in Venice, Italy to render Den Fears unconscious and rescue Harrison Fears. [Boys Will Be Seekers]"},{"heading":"International Names","level":2,"wikitext":"{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR = Songe-ténébreux\n|POR=Sono Negro}}\n\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Violet-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Mental spells]]\n[[Category:Blood Spiral magic]]\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation magic]]\n[[Category:Organization magic]]","text":""}],"full_text":"Darksleep is a spell that cause the target to fall asleep or to lose consciousness. During casting, caster's eyes glow violet while the hand is engulfed by a violet mist, which then surrounds the victim.\n\n== History ==\nThis spell was used by Zhalia Moon at Paris Catacombs on Unnamed Suit 001.[Divide and Conquer]\n\nThis spell was used again by Zhalia Moon at The Professor's castle on one of the Professor's Elite Suits. [The Divine Comedy] \n\nThe spell was used by Zhalia to knock out one of Wilder's Suits in Klaus' bookshop. Later, a Silent Soldier used it against another Suit who was guarding the entrance[The Blood Spiral]\n\nZhalia later used Darksleep in Venice, Italy to render Den Fears unconscious and rescue Harrison Fears. [Boys Will Be Seekers]\n\n==International Names==","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox spell\n|image = File:S1E25_Zhalia_darksleep.jpg\n|aura  = Violet\n|class = Mental\n|users = [[Silent Soldiers]] <br/> [[Zhalia Moon]]\n|first = \"[[Divide and Conquer]]\"\n}}\n'''Darksleep''' is a spell that cause the target to fall asleep or to lose consciousness. During casting, caster's eyes glow violet while the hand is engulfed by a violet mist, which then surrounds the victim.\n\n== History ==\nThis spell was used by [[Zhalia Moon]] at [[Paris Catacombs]] on [[Unnamed Suit 001]].{{Source|Divide and Conquer}}\n\nThis spell was used again by [[Zhalia Moon]] at [[The Professor's castle]] on one of [[the Professor]]'s Elite [[Suits]]. {{source|The Divine Comedy}} \n\nThe spell was used by Zhalia to knock out one of [[Wilder]]'s [[Suits]] in [[Klaus' bookshop]]. Later, a [[Silent Soldier]] used it against another [[Suit]] who was guarding the entrance{{Source|The Blood Spiral}}\n\nZhalia later used Darksleep in [[Venice, Italy]] to render [[Den Fears]] unconscious and rescue [[Harrison Fears]]. {{source|Boys Will Be Seekers}}\n\n{{Clear}}\n==International Names==\n{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR = Songe-ténébreux\n|POR=Sono Negro}}\n\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Violet-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Mental spells]]\n[[Category:Blood Spiral magic]]\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation magic]]\n[[Category:Organization magic]]","categories":["Blood Spiral magic","Huntik Foundation magic","Magic","Mental spells","Organization magic","Violet-aura spells"],"links":[{"target_title":"Silent Soldiers","label":"Silent Soldiers","target_id":"huntik:page:4383","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Silent_Soldiers","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4383"},{"target_title":"Zhalia Moon","label":"Zhalia Moon","target_id":"huntik:page:2000","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Zhalia_Moon","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2000"},{"target_title":"Divide and Conquer","label":"Divide and Conquer","target_id":"huntik:page:2722","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Divide_and_Conquer","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2722"},{"target_title":"Zhalia Moon","label":"Zhalia Moon","target_id":"huntik:page:2000","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Zhalia_Moon","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2000"},{"target_title":"Paris Catacombs","label":"Paris Catacombs","target_id":"huntik:page:4972","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Paris_Catacombs","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4972"},{"target_title":"Unnamed Suit 001","label":"Unnamed Suit 001","target_id":"huntik:page:17509","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Unnamed_Suit_001","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A17509"},{"target_title":"Zhalia Moon","label":"Zhalia Moon","target_id":"huntik:page:2000","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Zhalia_Moon","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2000"},{"target_title":"The Professor's castle",